				<description>The sixteenth Core Recalibration introduces the Principle of Optimal Load and the Management of Sufficiency Threshold. Drawing from iconographic craftsmanship, mathematical optimization, cybernetics, and long-term knowledge architecture, it demonstrates that mastery lies not in endless refinement, but in recognizing the precise moment when completion becomes an act of sovereignty.</description>
